---
title: "exchangeRate (Compound Whitepaper)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_supply: exchangeRateCurrent() called
    q_check_supply --> q_initial: cTokenSupply = 0 (no tokens minted yet)
    q_check_supply --> q_accrue: cTokenSupply > 0
    q_initial --> [*]: return initialExchangeRate
    q_accrue --> q_calc: accrueInterest()
    q_calc --> q_compute: cash = underlyingBalance of market
    q_compute --> q_return: exchangeRate = (cash + totalBorrows - reserves) / cTokenSupply
    q_return --> [*]: return exchangeRate

    note right of q_compute
        INV-001: exchangeRate = (cash + totalBorrows - reserves) / cTokenSupply
        INV-002: exchangeRate monotonically increases over time (due to interest accrual)
        INV-003: cash + totalBorrows - reserves >= 0 (reserves never exceed total assets)
    end note

    note right of q_initial
        INV-004: initialExchangeRate is set once at market creation and used only when cTokenSupply = 0
    end note
